				<title>SCP-911-J</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-911-j</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-911-j/oldman.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;oldman.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-911-J, wielding SCP-911-J-2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-911-J&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Keter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-911-J is currently uncontained due to it&#039;s anomalous properties. If SCP-911-J is encountered and you are alone, it &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;can not be stopped&lt;/span&gt; once it spots you, best course of action if encountered is to say your prayers and hope to god it shows mercy upon you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-911-J depicts itself as a male humanoid entity of elderly proportions, SCP-911-J appears to display Class-Five reality altering properties, as evident from it&#039;s behavior. SCP-911-J seems to mostly be active in most regions of North America, though rumors and local myths might hint that SCP-911-J is active internationally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-911-J was discovered by Foundation personnel after approximately 17 male personnel woke up missing their [DATA REDACTED]&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-871351-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; on 8/15/19██.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-911-J-2 is a standard issue Swiss Army Knife of unknown brand, it appears to show no anomalous properties other than SCP-911-J seeming to be able to pull it out of seemingly nowhere with ease according to witness reports from Foundation staff and other victims of SCP-911-J.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reports have shown that numerous members within numerous Groups of Interest are aware of SCP-911-J, and have expressed sorrow when asked any questions regarding SCP-911-J. Especially members of GOI-004, &amp;quot;The Church of the Broken God&amp;quot; and GOI-005 &amp;quot;Sarkic Cults,&amp;quot; referring to SCP-911-J as &amp;quot;The one we don&#039;t speak about.&amp;quot; Further research about these claims have shown mention of SCP-911-J in scriptures regarding Mekhane, mentioning that &amp;quot;he nearly chopped off the one thing that meant the most to Mekhane himself&amp;quot;&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-871351-2&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; before &amp;quot;banishing him for all of eternity because he was a total jerk to Mekhane.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When questioned about SCP-911-J, the Global Occult Coalition has expressed fear and frustration towards SCP-911-J, stating that it can&#039;t be stopped and that humanity as we know it is &amp;quot;doomed for the unforeseeable future.&amp;quot; Further questioning has led to the discovery of numerous destruction missions on SCP-911-J, all of which were unsuccessful, leaving no survivors on the GOC&#039;s side.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum 911-J.1:&lt;/strong&gt; The following message was sent by O5-█ in response to reviewing the following information:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Who approved this?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-871351-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. You know this is talking about.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-871351-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Mentions of this &amp;quot;thing&amp;quot; has never been said aside from in the use of this excerpt, but it is speculated to be SCP-████, which is currently in Foundation containment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bunnylord&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6953141&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607482210&quot; alt=&quot;BunnyLord&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6953141)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bunnylord&quot;  &gt;BunnyLord&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
