&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello, I&#039;m &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607482210&quot; alt=&quot;EstrellaYoshte&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte&quot;  &gt;EstrellaYoshte&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, aka &lt;strong&gt;SYwaves&lt;/strong&gt;, aka &amp;quot;the one who makes a bunch of logos&amp;quot;, aka &amp;quot;dude with one too many theme&amp;quot;, and this is my &amp;quot;author&amp;quot; page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m more of an artist by trade, and can be found lounging outside the wiki once in a blue moon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What other users say about me:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Estrella do you even have 3 articles that aren&#039;t themes?&lt;br /&gt;
- &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607482210&quot; alt=&quot;Uncle Nicolini&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini&quot;  &gt;Uncle Nicolini&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
