&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Exhibit&amp;nbsp;J:&amp;nbsp;Email&amp;nbsp;between&amp;nbsp;Dr.&amp;nbsp;Park&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Site&amp;nbsp;Director&amp;nbsp;Wakefield,&amp;nbsp;2022/11/18&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
