&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Subsequent events in the aftermath of Incident 5217-01 do not pertain to former Site Director Wakefield, and are thus omitted from this narrative. This narrative is concluded.&lt;/p&gt;
