					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5138</guid>
				<title>SCP-5138</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5138</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5138&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Euclid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Must be kept in a 2x2x2 foot steel box.&lt;br /&gt;
If SCP-5138 breaches, all personel on site must put on a gas mask.&lt;br /&gt;
No more than 2 personel may enter at any given time.&lt;br /&gt;
The box must be decontaminated and cleaned once a day.&lt;br /&gt;
Upon removal of SCP-5138-1 they must be put inside a steel box under the temperature of 0° Celcius for 24 hours.&lt;br /&gt;
Instances of SCP-5138-1 must be seperated from SCP-5083 to prevent replication of SCP-5138.&lt;br /&gt;
If SCP-5138-1 hatches, it is to be neutralized.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5138 appears to be a chicken that leaves behind radioactive waste that is similar to hydrochloric acid.&lt;br /&gt;
This radioactive waste is known as SCP-5138-2.&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5138-1 instances are eggs laid by SCP-5138.&lt;br /&gt;
They will taste like anything the consumer is craving.&lt;br /&gt;
Any living thing breathing SCP-5138-2 will instantly have a heart attack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drdoctordoctor&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7100224&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607482215&quot; alt=&quot;DrDoctorDoctor&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7100224)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drdoctordoctor&quot;  &gt;DrDoctorDoctor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 08 Dec 2020 22:02:54 +0000</pubDate>
												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-5138</p> <p><strong>Object Class:</strong> Euclid</p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong><br /> Must be kept in a 2x2x2 foot steel box.<br /> If SCP-5138 breaches, all personel on site must put on a gas mask.<br /> No more than 2 personel may enter at any given time.<br /> The box must be decontaminated and cleaned once a day.<br /> Upon removal of SCP-5138-1 they must be put inside a steel box under the temperature of 0° Celcius for 24 hours.<br /> Instances of SCP-5138-1 must be seperated from SCP-5083 to prevent replication of SCP-5138.<br /> If SCP-5138-1 hatches, it is to be neutralized.<br /> <strong>Description:</strong><br /> SCP-5138 appears to be a chicken that leaves behind radioactive waste that is similar to hydrochloric acid.<br /> This radioactive waste is known as SCP-5138-2.<br /> SCP-5138-1 instances are eggs laid by SCP-5138.<br /> They will taste like anything the consumer is craving.<br /> Any living thing breathing SCP-5138-2 will instantly have a heart attack.</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drdoctordoctor" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7100224&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607482215" alt="DrDoctorDoctor" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7100224)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drdoctordoctor" >DrDoctorDoctor</a></span></p> 
