&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-613174-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. Known symptom of abnormally low &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-4220&quot;&gt;orgone energy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-613174-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. This is highly unusual behavior for a Tartarean entity, as typically they will always accept being summoned so they can make deals for souls, their primary food source.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-613174-8&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;. This text was an informational cognitive lock, and thus was effectively incomprehensible causing mild headaches in people who read it. It is presumed that PoI-4174/01 was inoculated with a matching informational cognitive key to allow proper viewing. Attempts at recreating the possible cognition key are ongoing.&lt;/div&gt;
